      "old_sid": "s20",
      "new_sid": "s25",
      "quote": "And while some of the Report’s analysis rests on public reporting, and may correlate to how other markets function, the Report has value due to its underlying context: a more granular understanding than previously available of a handful of key partnerships between some of the largest technology companies and AI developers.",
      "status": "appended_complete_quote"
